OL,3,GNEWSAThe Ex-MI6 spy with 14 aliases and
OL,4,Amany disguises
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former MI6 intelligence officer is
OL,7,Fbehind a new stage show, lifting the
OL,8,Flid on what goes on at the UK's Secret
OL,9,FIntelligence Service.
OL,11,FMatthew Dunn spent years working in the
OL,12,Fintelligence community, which he said
OL,13,Fwas not all tuxedos, exotic locations,
OL,14,Fand evil billionaires trying to destroy
OL,15,Fcivilisation.
OL,17,FOperation MI6 starts a 70-date UK tour
OL,18,Fin Wolverhampton on Thursday, and
OL,19,Fdepicts two officers overseeing a live
OL,20,Foperation in eastern Europe.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
