OL,3,GNEWSAThe Ex-MI6 spy with 14 aliases and
OL,4,Amany disguises
OL,5,
OL,6,FDunn, from Stratford-upon-Avon, said:
OL,7,F"The audience will be taken into the
OL,8,Fheart of a modern MI6 control centre
OL,9,Fand via huge screen, they will see how
OL,10,FMI6 handles a rolling, overseas
OL,11,Foperation."
